# data-modeling skill

**Read and apply** `.cursor/skills/data-modeling/SKILL.md` before writing or changing this file.

Walk Rules 1–9 in the skill. The model is source of truth — then `alembic revision --autogenerate`, review, one concern per migration (ARCH §4.12).

Do **not** use this skill for repository/service/router code, Pydantic `schemas.py`, migration files, or tests.
